OL,3,AFirms scramble for battery power in
OL,4,ASpain and Portugal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the 28 April last year, Portugal and
OL,7,FSpain went dark for several hours.
OL,9,FA massive power failure caused
OL,10,Fwidespread chaos. People dug out
OL,11,Flanterns and old radios, and companies
OL,12,Fscrambled to save what production they
OL,13,Fcould.
OL,15,FThe Spanish meat processing firm
OL,16,FFribin, in Binefar, in the north
OL,17,Feastern province of Aragon, was midway
OL,18,Fthrough its morning shift when the
OL,19,Fsudden shutdown brought production
OL,20,Flines to a halt.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
