OL,4,ASpain and Portugal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Andres Altabas, Fribin's technology
OL,7,Fand systems director, it was a
OL,8,Fnightmarish situation.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
