OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon and
OL,4,Alegendary philanthropist, dies aged 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegendary country music singer Dolly
OL,7,FParton has died at the age of 80
OL,9,F"Dolly Parton's legacy is one of love,
OL,10,Fcompassion, and resilience," her team
OL,11,Fsays - read their statement in full
OL,13,FThe country icon sold more than 100
OL,14,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,15,Fover 3,000 songs in a career that
OL,16,Fspanned six decades
OL,18,FParton also devoted decades of her life
OL,19,Fto charitable causes, particularly
OL,20,Fchild literacy and education
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
