OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon and
OL,4,Alegendary philanthropist, dies aged 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Paul McCartney says it's "hard to
OL,7,Fimagine" a world without Dolly, Oprah
OL,8,Fsays "we are all better because she was
OL,9,Fhere", and Sir Elton John says Parton
OL,10,Fwas "unique and irreplaceable"
OL,12,FRaised in poverty in a one-room cabin
OL,13,Fin the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee,
OL,14,FParton was the fourth youngest of 12
OL,15,Fchildren - her early life in pictures
OL,17,FParton's style was unapologetically
OL,18,Fbold, she wowed Glastonbury, starred in
OL,19,Fwell-known films and appealed to all
OL,20,Fages
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
